  c. detach a copy from this repository and publish it as your own project —
     for example by creating a new repository, site, app listing or portfolio
     entry under your own name or a new brand, presented as your original work;
  d. rebrand the Software (new name, new logo, new identity) in order to
     present it as something you created, or to imply that it is not based on
     SketchSpace;
  e. use the "SketchSpace" name or logo, or the Author's name, to promote your
     fork or any product in a way that implies endorsement, partnership or
     official status;
  f. sell the Software, or a Modification of it, as a standalone product where
     the value offered is the Software itself rather than your own additions;
